/src/generated/prisma/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Dynamically uploaded student profile images
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Do not publish user-uploaded profile photos.
# Keep approved static placeholders if required.
# Review these exceptions before using them.
public/images/profile/*
public/images/team/*
!public/images/profile/avatar.jpg
!public/images/profile/profile1.jpg

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Local project structure dumps
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Large diagnostic listings are not application source code.
PROJECT_STRUCTURE.txt